                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "4.6/10 - More Accurately Named \"Farty Pig\" the App.\n\nThis is another Angry Birds knock-off, with some elements that do make this game somewhat enjoyable. I just can't rate this positive when your character the piggy achieves flight by eating beans and farting. This has free Android app written all over it! The price isn't bad all things considered but there are better ways to spend $3.\n\nThis game does offer some cool building elements, you have to use additional items in order to clear a path for your farty pig to fly! I enjoyed this aspect of the game the most for sure! Overall, this game isn't terrible but not creative enough in all areas to get me excited enough to vote positive. \n\nWorth $0-2.99 based on how low your expectations are. There are 50 [strike]amazing[/strike] levels.\n\n[code][h1] Accidently Reviewed[/h1]\nWas this review helpful or maybe even not helpful? Either way join this group for more. Free Keys and Reviews weekly!\n[url=http://steamcommunity.com/groups/Accidently] Steam Group: AccidentlyReviewed[/url][/code]\n",
